      "captions": {
        "en": {
          "text": "Today’s fundraising briefing — 4 deals, the strategies behind them · 4 November 2026\n\n🔹 Wormsensing (vibration monitoring for industrial surveillance, France) — €9.5m.\n\n🔹 Aira (AI assistant for sales teams, Sweden) — $3.02m.\n\n🔹 Viridi (CO2 to chemicals conversion, United Kingdom) — €2.6m.\n\n🔹 Unitoq (real estate platform for the Latvian market, Latvia) — €155k · Pre-Seed.\n\n🔗 These deals and those of your markets, every morning: https://proplace.co/actualites/?lang=en&secteurs=industrial-tech-and-manufacturing,b2b-software-and-cloud,climate-and-energy-tech,construction-and-proptech",
